          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "e7c71c6c-490a-4ad5-9fb8-6108359b5d77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Try to collect at least a couple stories/ideas/problems.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "71be71bd-3fae-4c14-8b88-33b8373d1b22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here is a markdown template that you could use for taking notes, but do what you want for notes, just do keep notes.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "d43a0ae5-457a-4eb4-a6f2-687a5ff8cfbf",
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "# Need Finding Interviews\n\n## Interview 1:\n* name:\n* date:\n* occupation:\n* relationship to interviewers:\n* location:\n\n### Some potential questions to get you started\n\n* What does your day to day life look like?\n* What are the hardest parts of your day? In general/long term?\n* If you had a lot of skills and money, what would you make or do?\n* What is a time that you were pissed off at something?\n* What is a time you noticed a clever solution to something?\n* What are some things you like?\n* What do you dislike?\n* Products that you wished existed?\n* Could you tell me story about a time you ______?\n* What was your best/worst/craziest/most memorable experience with (area of focus)?\n* What would I find surprising about . . .?\n\n### Record Any Observations\n\n* What were they doing while you asked them stuff?\n* Any particular reactions / emotions during the interview or specific questions?\n\n### Reflect / Conclusions\n\n* Come up with a 1 or 2-sentence problem statement that summarizes what you heard.  Not a proposed solution, but the problem.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "d1774916-705d-4941-8cad-96b16b4212e5",
      "type": "paragraph",
